MODULE: SweepTerminatesNeverEntersRepair
TARGET: SweepTerminates
CLASS: Temporal
SUMMARY: The phase transition restarts probing instead of repairing.
PERTURBS: BeginRepair
--- FIND
    /\ phase' = "Repair" /\ cursor' = 0 /\ work' = 0
--- REPLACE
    \* MUTATION: a divergent sweep probes forever.
    /\ phase' = "Probe" /\ cursor' = 0 /\ work' = 0
--- END
